he coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{6\\cdot 0-(-5)\\cdot 8}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -8 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{40}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -8 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{40}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -8 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-12286/selection/ma-v1/64bb625b5f1b7f8fd701d569a234cfd5b9406fe13f3fe972dcd873684d98bd40"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-320803/field-1/d91744a5c266e927d72b0454bc3703b6092c60de074cab02ff1bf68f81fca69b" :answer/id #uuid "eb802aaa-6f8e-5cf3-bed3-725de7ca309c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186291779 :answer-field/choices ["q-320803/field-1/d91744a5c266e927d72b0454bc3703b6092c60de074cab02ff1bf68f81fca69b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}]
